"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-12-20T01:02:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T08:35:51Z","closed_at":"2025-12-24T16:48:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.6 Beta 2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta2 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9144) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900HX (32 threads) - 63.81 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing this as the basis for shortcut keys.\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/default_key_mapping.html\n\nThe Insert Key shortcut (INSERT) ( canvas_item_editor/anim_insert_key ) will only attempt to insert position and rotation keyframes regardless of what actual keyframes are already on the track.\n\nInsert Key (Existing Tracks) (CTRL + INSERT) (canvas_item_editor/anim_insert_key_existing_tracks) doesn't appear to do anything at all.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Attach an AnimationPlayer to a Node.\n2. Set Scale or a property that ISN'T position/rotation to the initial keyframe.\n3. Move ahead on the track. Select the property again and alter the value.\n4. Press the INSERT key on your keyboard.\n\nHere, you'll see that Godot will attempt to insert keyframes for position/rotation. If this is intended behavior, it should be made useful for any property to be animated instead of just position/rotation.\n\nInsert Key (Existing Tracks) just doesn't do anything at all even with the above setup.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"lil-sassy","id":2836215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MzYyMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2836215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy","html_url":"https://github.com/lil-sassy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lil-sassy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114226/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114226/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}